+
+## `claims/CLAIMS.md`
+
+In the `| Bc |` row, anchor on the exact sentence:
+
+> the `\|q_hard\|` factor is UNTESTED (all legs `\|q\|=1`) — charge-2 bound-state leg is the next falsifier
+
