+> the charge-two slope falsifier SURVIVED at finite volume: three-magnon ED at `N=100` measured `4.07001 +/- 0.08981` versus `\|q_hard\|/s=4` (`s=1/2`, pre-registered absolute window `0.35`; dense-sector oracle green and hopping mutation red). This is finite-packet evidence only: no `N`/width extrapolation and no charge-two kink-memory test; Bc remains CONJECTURE
+
+Append these lane artifacts to the row's final evidence cell:
+
