+
+## `theory/TRIANGLE.md`
+
+Anchor on:
+
+> Every tested leg has unit charge, so the `|q_hard|>1` factor remains open (`tns-ebh`), with a charge-2 bound state the next falsifier.
+
+Replace it with:
+
+> The first charge-two slope falsifier survives at finite volume: an `N=100` three-magnon ED wavepacket experiment gives `4.07001 +/- 0.08981` against `|q_hard|/s=4`. This remains finite-packet evidence, not a proof: an `N`/width convergence study and the charge-two kink-memory experiment are open (`tns-ebh`).
